# 5.7 the user stops the session (leaves first, Monado after WayVR, the broker last); WayVR's Xid 31 on the way out
# sets the gate to caution, which warns only: the next start is not blocked.
start desk
at 10 cmd session=off
expect 11 ran stop perf
expect 30 ran stop monado
expect 40 ran stop broker
expect 40 intent off
at 41 klog NVRM: Xid (PCI:0000:01:00): 31, pid=1007, name=wayvr, channel 0x00000013
expect 42 gate caution
expect 42 notified GPU warning
at 100 cmd session=on
expect 102 ran start monado
